            "review_text": "TruongPham\n3 contributions\n0\nDelicious Trip\nApr 2025 • Family\nDelicious food, fresh meat of the day marinated with traditional Vietnamese spices. The airy space creates a comfortable and relaxing feeling when sitting and eating here. The service is very good, the staff is friendly and enthusiastic.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 5, 2025",
